==Trivia==
*The word "Nylocas" is very similar to the Hungarian word "Nyolcas", meaning "eight", referencing the eight legs of this arachnid-like creature.
*The latter part of the name of the Nylocas Vasilias likely derives from the Greek term "βασιλιάς" ("vasiliás"), meaning "king", referencing its background within the lore and its role as a boss encounter.

